b:["$","p","I did not arrive at design in a straight line. Before becoming a designer, I worked in sales, hospitality, and even produced music as a freelancer. At that time, it felt like I was just trying different things and figuring life out one chapter at a time.",{"children":"I did not arrive at design in a straight line. Before becoming a designer, I worked in sales, hospitality, and even produced music as a freelancer. At that time, it felt like I was just trying different things and figuring life out one chapter at a time."}]
c:["$","p","But once I became a designer, everything started to connect.",{"children":"But once I became a designer, everything started to connect."}]
d:["$","p","Sales taught me how to understand value, present ideas, and see a product from a business point of view. Hospitality taught me how to interact with people, make them feel comfortable, and notice the small details that shape an experience. Music taught me patience, emotion, rhythm, and the discipline to keep creating until something feels right.",{"children":"Sales taught me how to understand value, present ideas, and see a product from a business point of view. Hospitality taught me how to interact with people, make them feel comfortable, and notice the small details that shape an experience. Music taught me patience, emotion, rhythm, and the discipline to keep creating until something feels right."}]
e:["$","p","For a long time, I thought these were separate parts of my life. Now I see them as the foundation of how I design.",{"children":"For a long time, I thought these were separate parts of my life. Now I see them as the foundation of how I design."}]
f:["$","p","The path was messy, but I am glad I lived it. Every part of it made me a better designer.",{"children":"The path was messy, but I am glad I lived it. Every part of it made me a better designer."}]
